43
00:07:13,839 --> 00:07:17,872
[Host] Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

44
00:07:18,471 --> 00:07:24,303
[Slow] シルバーウィークの連休は、何日間ですか。

45
00:07:25,103 --> 00:07:29,088
[Host] Five days — from September nineteenth to the twenty-third.

46
00:07:29,687 --> 00:07:35,279
[Slow] 9月21日は、何の日ですか。

47
00:07:36,079 --> 00:07:41,552
[Host] It is Respect for the Aged Day, a national holiday to honor elderly people.

48
00:07:42,151 --> 00:07:48,728
[Slow] 海外旅行で一番人気がある場所は、どこですか。

49
00:07:49,528 --> 00:07:51,399
[Host] Hawaii.

50
00:07:52,000 --> 00:08:02,872
[Host] That's all for today. If you are in Japan, enjoy the long holiday — and if you travel, the trains will be crowded, so plan ahead. See you tomorrow!

51
00:08:03,471 --> 00:08:05,872
[News] また明日。
